        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lumerok pa jo Juda ki jo pa Benjamin guwinyo ni jo ma gudwo go ki i opii i rok gitye ka gero ot pa Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.24+2KI.17.25+2KI.17.26+2KI.17.27+2KI.17.28+2KI.17.29+2KI.17.30+2KI.17.31+2KI.17.32+2KI.17.33+2KI.17.34+2KI.17.35+2KI.17.36+2KI.17.37+2KI.17.38+2KI.17.39+2KI.17.40+2KI.17.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Luker 17.24-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci cut gubino bot Jerubabel ki ludito ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarogi kun giwaco botgi ni, “Wuwek waribbe kwedwu i gedo man, pien wan bene waworo Lubaŋawu-ni macalo wun, dok wan bene wabedo ka tyero gitum bote cakke wa i kare pa Ecar-kadon kabaka me Aciria ma yam okelowa kany-nyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Jerubabel, ki Yecwa, ki ludito mukene ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarogi ma i Icrael gugamo doggi ni, “Wun pe wutwero ribbe kwedwa me gero ot mo pi Lubaŋawa; wan kenwa watwero gero ot pi Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael, macalo kabaka Ciro kabaka me Percia yam ociko ki wan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok lwak jo mukene ma gitye i lobo-nu gucako balo cwiny jo Juda woko, omiyo gubedo ki lworo me gedo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo meno guwilo lumi-tam pa kabaka mogo me balo ticgi woko, i kare pa Ciro kabaka me Percia, nio kwede wa i kare me loc pa Dario kabaka me Percia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
